title Cluster and Architecture Detection Flow

participant "Client" as Client
participant "SignatureBuilder" as Builder
participant "BuildSystemDetector" as BuildDetector
participant "ModulePatternDetector" as PatternDetector
participant "FrameworkDetector" as FrameworkDetector
participant "Cluster Detection" as Cluster
participant "Confidence Evaluator" as Confidence
participant "LLM Client" as LLM
participant "ArchitectureSignature" as Signature

Client->Builder: build()
activate Builder

Builder->BuildDetector: detect()
BuildDetector-->Builder: BuildSystemResult

Builder->PatternDetector: detect()
PatternDetector-->Builder: ModulePatternResult

Builder->Cluster: detectBuildModules()
Cluster->Cluster: Check settings.gradle.kts
Cluster->Cluster: Check pom.xml
Cluster-->Builder: buildModules (if found)

alt Build modules found
    Builder->Cluster: Use build modules as clusters
else No build modules
    Builder->Cluster: Scan directory structure
    Cluster->Cluster: Detect source directories
    Cluster->Cluster: Count source files
    Cluster-->Builder: clusters from directory structure
end

Builder->Builder: For each cluster:
    Builder->FrameworkDetector: detect(modulePath)
    FrameworkDetector-->Builder: FrameworkResult
    
    Builder->Builder: Detect design patterns
    Builder->Builder: Detect language features
    
    Builder->Confidence: calculateModuleConfidence()
    Confidence-->Builder: confidence score
    
    alt confidence >= threshold
        Builder->Builder: Accept heuristic result
    else confidence < threshold AND useLlmForLowConfidence = true
        Builder->LLM: detectWithLLM(cluster, heuristic)
        LLM-->Builder: LLM result
        Builder->Builder: Merge heuristic + LLM results
    else confidence < threshold AND LLM disabled
        Builder->Builder: Mark as low confidence
        Builder->Builder: Flag for review
    end
end

Builder->Builder: detectDeploymentPattern(clusters)
Builder->Builder: Derive deployment pattern from cluster analysis
note right of Builder: Deployment pattern derived from:\n- cluster count\n- cluster independence\n- build module structure

Builder->Signature: ArchitectureSignature(
    buildSystem,
    moduleFrameworks,
    modulePatterns,
    clusters,
    moduleDesignPatterns,
    moduleLanguageFeatures,
    deploymentPattern,
    confidence
)
Signature-->Client: Complete signature

deactivate Builder
